From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Let devices override the Codec2 HAL selection

Default media.c2.hal.selection to aidl instead of forcing it, so a device
whose vendor Codec2 HAL is HIDL-only can select hidl without a duplicate
property assignment.

---
diff --git a/properties/vendor.prop b/properties/vendor.prop
index 0004f13..3ba74fd 100644
--- a/properties/vendor.prop
+++ b/properties/vendor.prop
@@ -11,6 +11,6 @@ ro.incremental.enable=1
 vendor.light.backlight.disable?=true
 
 # Media
-media.c2.hal.selection=aidl
+media.c2.hal.selection?=aidl
 debug.c2.use_dmabufheaps=1
 debug.stagefright.c2inputsurface=-1
